(7545943, 1208406, 61651, '<td valign="top">I am so glad to see that you did this - I was going to do the exact same thing, with the same title, but had no time to travel to my nearest viaduct :) Great image.</td>', 'I am so glad to see that you did this - I was going to do the exact same thing, with the same title, but had no time to travel to my nearest viaduct :) Great image.', '2017-11-22 09:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
