(7546014, 1208422, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ha!  At least you''re not trying to hide the creative side of your entry.  For that I''ll reward it with a healthy vote.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ha!  At least you''re not trying to hide the creative side of your entry.  For that I''ll reward it with a healthy vote.  Good luck.', '2017-11-22 23:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
