(7546405, 1208318, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool! <br/>I''m commenting only, as I didn''t do my homework.</td>', 'This is pretty cool! I''m commenting only, as I didn''t do my homework.', '2017-11-27 18:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546450, 1208385, 173844, '<td valign="top">So well done.  The photo perfectly sets up the conception that they''re here with us -  not really, because the drawing is in pen, and so all the more poignant.  The drawing is terrific, the likenesses and scaling impressive.  Such a touching, moving (no pun intended) image.</td>', 'So well done.  The photo perfectly sets up the conception that they''re here with us -  not really, because the drawing is in pen, and so all the more poignant.  The drawing is terrific, the likenesses and scaling impressive.  Such a touching, moving (no pun intended) image.', '2017-11-28 11:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546451, 1208421, 173844, '<td valign="top">Seemingly simple, wonderful effect.  It works on an almost subliminal level.  That it''s in black and white just adds to the impact.  A lesson on how one spins artistry from the mundane.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Seemingly simple, wonderful effect.  It works on an almost subliminal level.  That it''s in black and white just adds to the impact.  A lesson on how one spins artistry from the mundane.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2017-11-28 11:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546452, 1208318, 173844, '<td valign="top">If you got it, flaunt it, Lydia.  Funnest image in the challenge.  I see the frigate but not the picture of Andrew Jackson -  must be up front.  Beautifully done, and what a becoming partner!  The tones of the figures are nicely set off by the brownish, heavily vignetted background. C''est magnifique. <br/>(Now that spellcheck let through "funnest" I can hardly wait to use "funner".)</td>', 'If you got it, flaunt it, Lydia.  Funnest image in the challenge.  I see the frigate but not the picture of Andrew Jackson -  must be up front.  Beautifully done, and what a becoming partner!  The tones of the figures are nicely set off by the brownish, heavily vignetted background. C''est magnifique. (Now that spellcheck let through "funnest" I can hardly wait to use "funner".)', '2017-11-28 11:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546455, 1208422, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fun mock-up of "You Bet Your Life," done in 1950''s tv mode.  The feel is all there, down to George Fenneman''s usual befuddled expression.  Nice graininess, which confers the sense of bygone times.</td>', 'Fun mock-up of "You Bet Your Life," done in 1950''s tv mode.  The feel is all there, down to George Fenneman''s usual befuddled expression.  Nice graininess, which confers the sense of bygone times.', '2017-11-28 12:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546456, 1208407, 173844, '<td valign="top">Stylish essence of Groucho, cleverly put together.  He''s unmistakable.</td>', 'Stylish essence of Groucho, cleverly put together.  He''s unmistakable.', '2017-11-28 12:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546457, 1208386, 173844, '<td valign="top">Whoa there, momentito.  Great doppelganger.  Unless you know this gentleman, what a happy find.  With that cleft chin, he goes Groucho one better.  One can only hope he''s aware of the resemblance and works some funny mannerisms and routines into his daily life.  I know I would, but then again I look like Oliver Hardy.</td>', 'Whoa there, momentito.  Great doppelganger.  Unless you know this gentleman, what a happy find.  With that cleft chin, he goes Groucho one better.  One can only hope he''s aware of the resemblance and works some funny mannerisms and routines into his daily life.  I know I would, but then again I look like Oliver Hardy.', '2017-11-28 12:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546458, 1208413, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perfect title for this amusing image.  The placement of the shirt logo should have tipped these guys off, but maybe this is further along in the routine.  I like that they''re having fun in their impression.  Nice.</td>', 'Perfect title for this amusing image.  The placement of the shirt logo should have tipped these guys off, but maybe this is further along in the routine.  I like that they''re having fun in their impression.  Nice.', '2017-11-28 12:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546459, 1208418, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wild but, and here''s that inevitable word again, fun.  In his travels Groucho''s picked up a little Salvador Dali and Robinson Crusoe along the way.  I can''t help but feel that the Man would get a kick out of this homage.</td>', 'Wild but, and here''s that inevitable word again, fun.  In his travels Groucho''s picked up a little Salvador Dali and Robinson Crusoe along the way.  I can''t help but feel that the Man would get a kick out of this homage.', '2017-11-28 12:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546461, 1208406, 173844, '<td valign="top">The famous line illustrated very prettily by this viaduct drenched in the sun''s glow.  And as for why, why not?</td>', 'The famous line illustrated very prettily by this viaduct drenched in the sun''s glow.  And as for why, why not?', '2017-11-28 13:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546462, 1208373, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the image, part murky dark and part glowing intensity.  The quote may be appropriate to the situation shown, but otherwise the connection to the Marx Brothers is, likewise, murky.</td>', 'I like the image, part murky dark and part glowing intensity.  The quote may be appropriate to the situation shown, but otherwise the connection to the Marx Brothers is, likewise, murky.', '2017-11-28 13:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546467, 1208402, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing poster for the movie, though I see no references to the actual movie itself.  Sprightly colors used in an artful manner.  Nice portrayal of Groucho.  Let the show begin.</td>', 'Very pleasing poster for the movie, though I see no references to the actual movie itself.  Sprightly colors used in an artful manner.  Nice portrayal of Groucho.  Let the show begin.', '2017-11-28 13:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546470, 1208158, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this image, richly colored and hectic.  A bit of a stretch from the Marx Brothers aside from the title, but that''s my problem.</td>', 'I like this image, richly colored and hectic.  A bit of a stretch from the Marx Brothers aside from the title, but that''s my problem.', '2017-11-28 13:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546471, 1208399, 173844, '<td valign="top">Way too subtle for me, and I tried.  Waldo has left the building.</td>', 'Way too subtle for me, and I tried.  Waldo has left the building.', '2017-11-28 13:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546473, 1208363, 173844, '<td valign="top">That''s the look.  He''s in for some groveling and heartfelt promises.  And she''d like a print of the photo for future keeping in line purposes.  Groucho would just sail on, but this is life unscripted.</td>', 'That''s the look.  He''s in for some groveling and heartfelt promises.  And she''d like a print of the photo for future keeping in line purposes.  Groucho would just sail on, but this is life unscripted.', '2017-11-28 13:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
