(7546511, 1208416, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image, but try as I might I couldn''t find any connection to the Marx Brothers.  Either it''s not there or I''m missing it.</td>', 'Very interesting image, but try as I might I couldn''t find any connection to the Marx Brothers.  Either it''s not there or I''m missing it.', '2017-11-28 22:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
