(7546513, 1208337, 173844, '<td valign="top">Can''t quite decide if that strip and box of green is sufficient to not decry the image as just a picture of someone else''s artwork.  It does let life through.  I guess I''ll give the photographer the benefit of the doubt -  my conferral, of course, is of no import beyond my own musing.</td>', 'Can''t quite decide if that strip and box of green is sufficient to not decry the image as just a picture of someone else''s artwork.  It does let life through.  I guess I''ll give the photographer the benefit of the doubt -  my conferral, of course, is of no import beyond my own musing.', '2017-11-28 22:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546514, 1208382, 173844, '<td valign="top">Unless the kid is pointing at the Marx Brothers, this is a bridge too far.  Though it''s always a pleasure to see the photo portrayed.</td>', 'Unless the kid is pointing at the Marx Brothers, this is a bridge too far.  Though it''s always a pleasure to see the photo portrayed.', '2017-11-28 22:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
